      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEO DEVERE (4) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (29.86) last time in a Grade 5 at Sandown. Has never been out of the money in four starts this course and distance. Has ability and looks hard to stop. PAW FAROK (1) produced a moderate effort last time when eighth at Sandown over 515m behind Dapper Chap (30.33) in a Grade 5. Boasts a strong record from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Should play a prominent role. INFRA ROCK (5) was resuming when finishing sixth at this track in a Grade 4/5 (27.94). Will be much improved. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to his name from six starts. Better than last start and can bounce back. BINDY BLAZER (7) warrants respect although new to this track.",
